OL,3,GNEWSAResident fined #600 after firm
OL,4,Afly-tipped rubbish
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter it was reported to the borough
OL,7,Fcouncil, officers found evidence
OL,8,Flinking the waste to the householder,
OL,9,Fwho was subsequently issued with a
OL,10,Ffixed penalty notice.
